The [[Broadcom]] logo, "BCM94331PCIEDUAL", and "200-120101-0050 A" :is silkscreened on the wireless module in the FCC photos. {{See also|Broadcom BCM94342EMC|Broadcom BCM94352Z}}
Per a C2PC, this device is used (or will be) in the models: *[[Apple AirPort Extreme Base Station A1408 (MD031LL/A)]] *[[Apple Time Capsule A1409 (2 TB, MD032LL/A)]]
BCM94331PCIEDUAL (SKU): Certification ID: WFA11860 *{{WiFiCert|WFA11860|06/13/2011}}
